<TextPage lang="en" title="Support" otherHref="/support/">
  <p>For the <strong>Kastoria City Buses</strong> app, for Android and iPhone.</p>

  <h2>Timetables, tickets, lost property</h2>
  <p>For anything about the buses themselves, contact Astiko KTEL Kastorias:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Archimidous 8, 52100 Kastoria, Greece</li>
    <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+302467083959">+30 24670 83959</a></li>
    <li>Email: <a href="mailto:astikast@otenet.gr">astikast@otenet.gr</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://astikoktelkastorias.gr">astikoktelkastorias.gr</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The app</h2>
  <p>
    If something doesn't work, you found a mistake in a timetable, or you have an idea, write to us on GitHub. You don't need to
    know how to code, just a GitHub account:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/Kastoria-Dev-Core/astiko-ktel-kastorias-app/issues/new">Android</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/Kastoria-Dev-Core/astiko-ktel-kastorias-ios/issues/new">iPhone</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>Tell us the app's version (in Settings, under "About this app") and what happened.</p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>The app collects no personal data. See the <a href="/en/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
</TextPage>
